       20.3  (bw   1.79 GiB/s, md   230.2 kIOPS)  + the OST's NVMe tier for the 300 s write phases (implemented: roce/native/ost_tier.c, io500_run.py --ost-tier auto; a no-op on a run that already had it -- its limits are then the drives' capacity and write bandwidth)
